  "body": "## Changelog\n* 203d7369ecb26c9adecadb501cd95682decdb527 fix(mcp): write MCP client configuration at 0600 (#5192)\n* d391775e236ad0cd19d46d5bc54f9e3bc6491bc3 mpg: route connect and proxy through the public Machines API (#5169)\n* eda6f443b37b428befffc0a4a2d949574e9f3161 fix(mpg): decouple proxy readiness from credentials (#5048)\n* 8a5607eed291ad3121b3847f9d2480de9cfc487b Write the config file atomically (#5190)\n* c71269c2df594eac8348e8a52758e0a920c13ca7 Move the remaining compact app lookups to Flaps and trim the client (#5188)\n* d3342db74f3e242d2f4b05dcbf482c94617d9aab Select organizations through ui-ex instead of GraphQL (#5186)\n* 33ae8677eacfbfcbc291d29ad1a778812002dd76 Take organization GraphQL IDs from ui-ex for app-scoped commands (#5185)\n* 8191715a4b90463ec4cc9680fd1bc5bfe4fed8b7 Use the ui-ex API for org and release lookups instead of GraphQL (#5184)\n* 7845aeb680caf6815ee283d4d4b013951b76374f Use Flaps for app and region lookups that only read Flaps-available f… (#5182)\n* 6619ad80888b64b8d8fc2bafa422249db1172a0f Use the Flaps app lookup instead of the full GraphQL GetApp query (#5181)\n* c1fea522c301eb21759c5648ebc74ca16a56c31e Route MPGv2 create through the Machines API (#5168)\n* cb23ac489239d6f840d71b31c8e0e97f3c9c200c Remove the LiteFS Cloud commands (#5187)\n* 1b36002fe3e156c9f61827d16984e5ba29822273 fix(auth): re-fetch all org tokens after re-login (#5180)\n\n"
}
